## What the game says when a way is refused or fatal. One key per code of
## UNDERG.BAS line 2870; the texts are lines 2880 to 2950.

define phrases en-US
  door-is-closed:
    The door is closed.
  drown-yourself:
    I wouldn't advise you to drown yourself.
  cant-get-up-ramp:
    You can't get up the ramp.
  barrel-spins:
    The barrel's spinning motion prevents you from moving this way.
  cannot-reach-hole:
    You cannot reach the hole.
  cyanide-atmosphere:
    You are on the surface on the planet, which has an atmosphere of cyanide gas.
  passage-blocked:
    This passage has been somehow blocked.
  inside-volcano:
    You are INSIDE an active volcano. Lava flies about in all directions.
